  <!-- 模块：植入体功能 -->
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.BrainImplants.Label>允许机械族机械师安装脑部植入体</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.BrainImplants.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.BrainImplants.Description>开启后，机械族机械师可以被右键下达安装脑部植入体的命令。此功能会略微影响游戏启动时的加载速度。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.BrainImplants.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.BrainImplants.RestartRequired>此设置将在重新启动游戏后生效。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.BrainImplants.RestartRequired>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.MoonImplants.Label>允许「月亮」安装仿生体</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.MoonImplants.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.MoonImplants.Description>开启后，「月亮」可以右键植入体物品执行安装。此功能会略微影响游戏启动时的加载速度。修改此设置后需要重新启动游戏。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.MoonImplants.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.MoonImplants.RestartRequired>该设置已更改，需要重新启动游戏后才能生效。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.MoonImplants.RestartRequired>

  <!-- 模块：仿生子嗣 -->
